        "headline": "Day 3: Desert Sage opens a forty-point lead",
        "summary": "Three competition days in, #129 has strung together the cleanest run of the field and pulled clear of a tight chase for second.",
        "as_of": "2026-10-10T14:02:00-07:00",
        "telling": [
          {
            "component": "Paragraph",
            "content": {
              "text": "The dunes decided it. Where most of the field lost points hunting the last blue checkpoint before the marathon stage, Desert Sage found it on the first pass and carried a clean sheet into camp."
            }
          },
          {
            "component": "Standings",
            "content": {
              "caption": "4x4 overall after Day 3",
