                  "points": 1090
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "component": "Paragraph",
            "content": {
              "text": "Second through fifth are inside fifty points of each other with the enduro still to come, which is closer than the top of the table has been at this point in any of the last three years."
            }
          },
          {
            "component": "Prose",
            "content": {
              "markdown": "### A measured lead\n\nThe **leaders** held their *line*. Read the [results](https://rebellerally.com/live).\n\n- First pass\n  - Keep the heading\n- Back to camp"
